        // qualifier FIRST, which is right for a CONTAINER (a secret rides the i64 slot
        // and the taint stays in the type system) and WRONG here, because a secret may
        // not cross a process pipe at all — that is ADR 0066 D8, pinned by
        // `tests/ui/c66_process_channel_secret_fence.sentinel`.
